aria-tailcat (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: ariacompute deployment launcher for github.com/tailscale/tailcat.
    Wraps tailcat as a long-running systemd service with YAML/flags/env config,
    supporting listen, forward, ssh, and exec serve modes, plus emSign trust-store
    hardening.

 -- jia <jia@ariacompute.com>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
